# Slice 283 probe: an ordinary Structure whose first two fields are Structures, standing in a callable's place and called.  Entry 7.
Other:
    A: (int: q 1)
    B: (int: r 2)
end: Other
Places:
    fn: f () int
        return: 1
    end: f
end: Places
int: Hw 0
fn: write_free () int
    @: Places\f Hw
    ---
        int: r Places\f()
        return: 21
        catch: call ()
            return: 1
    ---
end: write_free
fn: run () int
    @: Hw Other Other
    return: write_free()
end: run
int: code 7
if: run() != 1
    code: 12
---
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: code; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
